    "created_at": "2017-02-08T10:54:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-08T10:54:32Z",
    "body": "We could add a new `MediaError`, set the property and fire an event and maybe do the same when `play()` is called for consistency. However, there might be side effects with websites listening to the event and not expecting it to fire in this case.\r\n\r\nAnother indirect approach would be to make `preload` reflect the actual preload state (see #1932) and require user agents to set the `preload` property to `auto` when autoplay is enabled.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
