    "created_at": "2017-02-15T03:10:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-15T03:10:21Z",
    "body": "Exposing the real preload state would make sense to me. I guess it's not entirely obvious that this would be a way to detect support for autoplay, but to have an entirely redundant API exposing the same information also wouldn't be great.",
